==Trivia==
*Darkmadillo shares its name with one of the Dark [[wikia:moco-moco-friends:Plushkins|Plushkins]] from the game ''[[wikia:moco-moco-friends:Moco Moco Friends|Moco Moco Friends]]''.
*Darkmadillo's Japanese name, Kuromadillo (クロマジロ ''Kuromajiro''), is derived from 黒 ''kuro'' (black) and ''armadillo''.
*Darkmadillo is based on the [[wikipedia:Southern three-banded armadillo|southern three-banded armadillo]] or [[wikipedia:Brazilian three-banded armadillo|Brazilian three-banded armadillo]], which can roll up into a ball for defense. Its description mentioning soccer could be because both of these species are found in Brazil, where soccer is the most popular sport.
*Darkmadillo jumping in its attack animation may be a reference to the [[wikipedia:Nine-banded armadillo|nine-banded armadillo]], which has been known to jump straight upward 3-4 ft into the air when surprised.

